; PkgManager acceptance, second increment: start it detached with an event
; log and slowed transfers (--slow 300: about 0.3 s per 16 KB and a 3 s pause
; after extraction begins), so a cancel, a close or a concurrent CLI attempt
; can be timed by a script rather than by luck.
Copy PAYLOAD:PKGMGR RAM:PkgManager
Copy PAYLOAD:APKG RAM:apkg
Copy PAYLOAD:PUTFILE RAM:putfile
Protect RAM:PkgManager +e
Protect RAM:apkg +e
Protect RAM:putfile +e
Delete SYS:Packages ALL FORCE QUIET
Delete RAM:gui-#? QUIET
Run >NIL: RAM:PkgManager --slow 300 --log RAM:gui-events.log
